# Frontend (Astro + React)

Follow ADR 0005.

- Astro pages and layouts are the shell. React is only an island (`client:load`, `client:idle`, `client:visible`, …).
- Do not add Astro endpoints or server actions that duplicate the Hono API.
- The browser calls same-origin `/jobs`, `/applications`, `/candidates`, and `/auth`. The Vite/dev proxy (and later a reverse proxy) forwards those prefixes to the server on port 3000.
- Do not store JWTs in `localStorage`. Sessions are Auth.js HTTP-only cookies from ADR 0003.
- No product screens until the `.scratch/frontend/` wayfinder map is empty.
